<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><gml:doc xmlns:gml="urn:x-gml:canonical"><gdoc><body><h1 anchor="gml-h1-1">Line-counted words</h1>
<p>start
<gml:in left="3" unit="ch" temporary="yes" for="2" for-unit="line" break="yes"/>two lines
indented
back
<gml:scope kind="block" in="4ch"><gml:br break="yes" cause="in"/>one line
then indented
<gml:il shift="2" unit="ch" break="yes"/>indented line
<gml:un shift="-2" unit="ch" break="yes"/>undented line
<gml:lines word="uc" n="1" break="no">underscore caps</gml:lines>
<gml:rc code="1" char="|" break="no"/><gml:lines word="rc" n="1" char="|" break="no">revised</gml:lines>
<gml:sx left="left" fill="." right="right" break="yes"/><gml:hr repeat="yes" break="yes"/><gml:sk n="2" unit="line" break="yes"/><gml:kp mode="on" break="yes"/>kept
<gml:kp mode="off" break="yes"/></gml:scope><gml:lines word="ce" n="on" break="yes">first centred
second centred
</gml:lines></p><p>A distance is a float before the next text: each paragraph below is
one block.
<gml:in left="4" unit="ch" delta="+4" temporary="yes" for="2" for-unit="line" after="2" after-unit="line" break="yes"/></p><p>A paragraph of
three input lines
in one block.
</p><p><gml:il shift="3" unit="ch" break="yes"/>An indented first line
and a second one.
</p><p>A length:
<gml:in left="1" unit="i" temporary="yes" for="0.5" for-unit="i" break="yes"/>half an inch at one inch.
<gml:ir right="6" unit="ch" temporary="yes" for="3" for-unit="line" break="yes"/></p><p>Three lines with a right indention.
<gml:il shift="5" unit="ch" break="yes"/></p><p>An .il before a paragraph tag: its skip uses it up.
</p><p><gml:un shift="-2" unit="ch" break="yes"/>A first line moved left
of the margin.
<gml:in left="2" unit="ch" temporary="yes" for="1" for-unit="line" break="yes"/><gml:in left="5" unit="ch" temporary="yes" for="2" for-unit="line" break="yes"/></p><p>Only the second of two FOR before the text counts.
</p><gml:scope kind="block" in="3ch"><p>A permanent change.
<gml:in left="5" unit="ch" temporary="yes" for="2" for-unit="line" break="yes"/></p><p>Back to the permanent one plus two.
<gml:scope kind="block" in="0"><gml:br break="yes" cause="in"/><gml:il shift="2" unit="ch" break="yes"/><gml:br break="yes"/></gml:scope></p></gml:scope><p>A skip between.
</p></body></gdoc></gml:doc>